        "explanation": "The change adds a call to s.search.TotalDocs() in searchSupport.init, after the goroutine that handles write events has already started. BuildIndex now writes b.cache under cacheMu only around the assignment. TotalDocs ranges over b.cache with no lock. If a write event triggers handleEvent, getOrCreateIndex and BuildIndex while TotalDocs is iterating, the map is read and written concurrently. This can cause a Go \"concurrent map iteration and map write\" fatal error. The same unlocked iteration also races with concurrent BuildIndex calls from other goroutines.",
